---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="THE DIFFERENCE // GENESIS - TESIS">
  <main class="moment-page genesis-page">
    
    <header class="moment-header">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← VOLVER AL INICIO</a>
      <nav class="moment-nav">
        <a href="/tesis" class="nav-active">GENESIS</a>
        <a href="/antitesis" class="nav-link">ANTITESIS</a>
        <a href="/sintesis" class="nav-link">SINTESIS</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="moment-container">
      <div class="moment-badge genesis-badge">[GENESIS]</div>
      
      <h1 class="moment-title">EL ORIGEN</h1>
      <h2 class="moment-subtitle">TESIS FUNDACIONAL</h2>

      <div class="moment-content">
        <div class="content-block">
          <h3>Neurodivergence + Creative Philosophy + System Log Human + ARS TEKNE + AI</h3>
          <p>QuantumLab es un laboratorio de investigación, creación y desarrollo donde convergen filosofía, arte, tecnología e inteligencia artificial para explorar nuevas formas de comprender la experiencia humana.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content-block highlight">
          <h3>El Pensamiento Autista como Fundamento</h3>
          <p>Su fundamento es el <strong>Pensamiento Autista</strong>, entendido no como una categoría clínica, sino como un <strong>modelo epistemológico</strong> que privilegia:</p>
          <ul class="feature-list">
            <li>La observación profunda</li>
            <li>El reconocimiento de patrones</li>
            <li>La fenomenología</li>
            <li>El pensamiento crítico</li>
            <li>La creación de sistemas</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="moment-footer-nav">
          <span class="footer-label">Este es el comienzo del viaje</span>
          <a href="/antitesis" class="next-link">ANTITESIS →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :root {
    --bg-dark: #000000;
    --text-white: #ffffff;
    --punk-pink: #ff3e96;
    --matrix-green: #00ff00;
    --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    --font-mono: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  .moment-page {
    background-color: var(--bg-dark);
    color: var(--text-white);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .moment-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--text-white);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .back-link:hover { color: var(--punk-pink); }

  .moment-nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .nav-link, .nav-active {
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .nav-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--punk-pink);
    color: var(--punk-pink);
  }

  .nav-active {
    border-color: var(--matrix-green);
    color: var(--matrix-green);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .moment-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .moment-badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--matrix-green);
    color: var(--matrix-green);
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .genesis-badge { border-color: var(--matrix-green); color: var(--matrix-green); }

  .moment-title {
    font-size: 4rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: normal;
  }

  .moment-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--matrix-green);
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1rem;
  }

  .moment-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .content-block {
    padding: 30px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }

  .content-block h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: var(--text-white);
    font-weight: normal;
    letter-spacing: 0.05rem;
  }

  .content-block p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .content-block.highlight {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--matrix-green);
    background: rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.03);
  }

  .feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding-left: 10px;
  }

  .feature-list li {
    padding: 10px 0 10px 30px;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #c0c0c0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .feature-list li::before {
    content: "▹";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--matrix-green);
  }

  .moment-footer-nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 60px;
    padding-top: 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .footer-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #666;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .next-link {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--matrix-green);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    border: 1px solid var(--matrix-green);
    padding: 12px 30px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .next-link:hover {
    background: var(--matrix-green);
    color: var(--bg-dark);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .moment-title { font-size: 2.5rem; }
    .moment-subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .moment-nav { flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .content-block { padding: 20px; }
  }
</style>